 filename←GetFileName name;filename_2
⍝ Returns the name of the file `name` is kept in, or an empty vector in case it cannot be established.\\
⍝ A project is managed either by Link or by acre, never by both, therefore Link is asked first,
⍝ and acre is consulted only when Link does not know the object.\\
 filename←''
 :If 9=⎕SE.⎕NC'Link'
     filename←⎕SE.Link.GetFileName name
 :EndIf
 :If 0=≢filename
 :AndIf U.AcreIsAvailable
     filename_2←⊃⎕SE.acre.Sourcefile name
     :If ⎕NEXISTS filename_2
         filename←filename_2
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
⍝Done
